{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GuHVdcK58upvWKNcCwx4a4","type":"tool_result","content":"911->\n912-> The failure mode of the pre-standard world is also worth keeping. It was not that ships were slow. It was that every combination of cargo and carrier was a bespoke problem, so effort spent solving one combination taught you nothing about the next. That is exactly the failure mode that a platform without published interfaces has, and it is exactly why the next four chapters keep finding the same design decision underneath different subjects.\n913-\n914:And that is the plant. This is the **first** of four times you will see this move. Storage does it. Networking does it. The API itself does it. When those three have all landed, the book collects them, and the collecting is meant to feel like recognition rather than a fourth list *[cross-bearing: see Ch 17 §4 — the four pluggable interfaces, collected]*.\n915-\n916----\n917-"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aa5db13d-100b-4b10-b3c7-dabe0218186d","uuid":"662d1064-0fea-4c15-9409-b45d1ac1db39","timestamp":"2026-08-31T14:47:19.814Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"911->\n912-> The failure mode of the pre-standard world is also worth keeping. It was not that ships were slow. It was that every combination of cargo and carrier was a bespoke problem, so effort spent solving one combination taught you nothing about the next. That is exactly the failure mode that a platform without published interfaces has, and it is exactly why the next four chapters keep finding the same design decision underneath different subjects.\n913-\n914:And that is the plant. This is the **first** of four times you will see this move. Storage does it. Networking does it. The API itself does it. When those three have all landed, the book collects them, and the collecting is meant to feel like recognition rather than a fourth list *[cross-bearing: see Ch 17 §4 — the four pluggable interfaces, collected]*.\n915-\n916----\n917-","numLines":7,"totalLines":7}}
