{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ABHfRC18j2zqdzZ43LUs77","type":"tool_result","content":"180\tLet me be direct about what this book is not. It is **not a kubectl drill book.** There are commands in it, because you cannot understand a Service without seeing how one is described, but the commands are here to illuminate concepts, not to build reflexes. When you want the reflexes, and if you stay in this field you will, the Certified Kubernetes Administrator is the next voyage: a genuinely hands-on exam taken in a live terminal [source: lf-cloud-native-certification-catalog-2026-08-23]. Lodestar Ledgers publishes a guide for that one too."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aa5db13d-100b-4b10-b3c7-dabe0218186d","uuid":"16a28319-5a9f-4083-b6b7-7fefcd75c235","timestamp":"2026-08-31T14:48:02.983Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/dev/lodestar/Book-KCNA/chapter-01-taking-departure.md","content":"Let me be direct about what this book is not. It is **not a kubectl drill book.** There are commands in it, because you cannot understand a Service without seeing how one is described, but the commands are here to illuminate concepts, not to build reflexes. When you want the reflexes, and if you stay in this field you will, the Certified Kubernetes Administrator is the next voyage: a genuinely hands-on exam taken in a live terminal [source: lf-cloud-native-certification-catalog-2026-08-23]. Lodestar Ledgers publishes a guide for that one too.","numLines":1,"startLine":180,"totalLines":591}}}
